 "title": "Time Zones",
 "hook": "The data this week comes from the IANA tz database via the {clock} and {tzdb} packages. Special thanks to Davis Vaughan for the assist in preparing this data! Many websites operate using the data in the IANA tz database. \"What Is Daylight Saving Time\" from timeanddate.com is a good place to start to find interesting information about time zones, such as the strange case of Lord Howe Island, Australia. Changes in the conversion of a given time zone to UTC (for example for daylight savings or because the definition of the time zone changed). Descriptions of time zones from the IANA time zone database. Countries (or other place names) that overlap with each time zone. Names of countries and other places.",
